    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for ntfs-3g_ntfsprogs",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for ntfs-3g_ntfsprogs fixes the following issues:\n\n- Denial-of-service in ntfs_inode_attach_all_extents() (bsc#1281758).\n- Heap buffer overflow in ntfs_acl_owner() (bsc#1281756).\n- Heap buffer overflow in ntfs_check_restart_area() (bsc#1281759).\n- Heap buffer overflow in ntfs_ea_check_wsldev() (bsc#1281760).\n- Heap buffer overflow in ntfs_external_attr_find() (bsc#1281761).\n- Heap buffer overflow in ntfs_same_sid() (bsc#1281757).\n- Heap data corruption in ntfs_mapping_pairs_decompress_i() (bsc#1281762).\n- Heap out of bounds read/write in ntfs_ie_add_vcn() (bsc#1281763).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "details",
        "text": "SUSE-2026-4399,SUSE-SLE-SERVER-12-SP5-LTSS-EXTENDED-SECURITY-2026-4399",
        "title": "Patchnames"
